22
00:01:29.087 --> 00:01:31.527
♪ Not sure what's where? Run git status — it lays it out for you: ♪

23
00:01:31.527 --> 00:01:34.200
♪ what's staged, what's changed but isn't staged, and which files are new. ♪

24
00:01:34.500 --> 00:01:39.080
