37
00:02:19.919 --> 00:02:24.379
(narrator) Its ID is a long hexadecimal hash, and changing one byte gives a different hash.

38
00:02:24.379 --> 00:02:31.794
(narrator) In a commit graph, git commit --amend adds a new commit beside the old one and moves main to it; the old commit turns grey but stays.

39
00:02:31.794 --> 00:02:37.370
