00:03:35.272 --> 00:03:38.981
(narrator) git branch feature adds a label instantly, and git commit moves main up.

62
00:03:38.981 --> 00:03:43.719
(narrator) git switch feature moves HEAD, and git switch -c ui creates a new branch and switches to it.

63
